  <!--
    NuGet package versions, in one place.

    The four WindowsAppSDK entries are one group, pinned to the versions the
    app's Microsoft.WindowsAppSDK 2.5.1 meta-package resolves (see
    mpv-winui/mpv-winui/mpv-winui.csproj and mpv-winrt/packages.config).
    mpv_winrt.dll runs in the app's process, so its components must come from
    the same family the app ships. Bump all four together, never one alone.
  -->
